    {
      "source": "Return the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLWarning.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>SQLWarning</code></a>.",
