      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If an SQLWarning is reported, the operation completed, so we will need\nto explicitly roll it back if we're not happy when looking at the warning.\nWe might choose to ignore (and log) the warning, or to wrap and throw it\nin the shape of this SQLWarningException instead.",
      "translation": "如果报告了 `SQLWarning`，则操作已完成，因此如果我们查看警告后不满意，就需要显式地回滚。我们可能会选择忽略（并记录）该警告，或者将其包装成 `SQLWarningException` 形式抛出。",
      "count": 2
    },
